7|0@Terraria^1438638199#ctqdqxo:MirTemporal$:I love a lot of NPCs. I may as well talk about all my favorites. * Nurse: I love setting her up near boss arenas or spawn points. She's helped with many a coop expert mode boss fights. * Painter: Building has a whole new meaning when you can choose what color anything and everything can be. * Mechanic: This one's pretty obvious. Wiring is amazing. * Steampunker: Teleporters and the Clemtaminator are excellent time. But above all, my number one favorite NPC is the * Party Girl: Her party items are some of the most fun stuff to use during coop. Blasting confetti after a tough boss fight and setting up fireworks is all a good time. Even outside of celebrating, she helps with the fight too by selling bubbles. Place a few honey filled bubbles in the arena to run into for the enhanced 30 seconds of regen. Let's not forget, what other NPC is so happy to see you that they start blasting you with confetti? Love you, Trixy, pls don't get killed by wraiths again.
